COMPILATION OF: E52H

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52H

   1 a 0000 E52H:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-52/P1] THREE SCOPES, INNER WRITE RESOLVES THROUGH MID:
   4 a 0006      main x fixed dec(4,2) stores 3; mid m declares x fixed
   5 a 0006      dec(9,2) and stores 3; innermost n declares NO x and stores x
   6 a 0006      = 3. Lexical scoping binds ns x to Ms dec(9,2) cell -- the
   7 a 0006      store image is 5 B and dedups onto Ms EXISTING cell (pool 3 +
   8 a 0006      5 = 8, DATA 16 including the two variable cells). An
   9 a 0006      own-plus-main-only environment binds it to MAINs dec(4,2) --
  10 a 0006      image 3 B, dedups onto main s cell, same DATA 16. The
  11 a 0006      DISCRIMINATOR IS CODE: which *S operand ns LXI H loads (3-byte
  12 a 0006      vs 5-byte cell) and the DLDOP width byte. MINE refuses today
  13 a 0006      (main vs mid clash). */
  14 c 0006   dcl x fixed dec(4,2);
  15 c 0006   x = 3;
  16 c 0016   call m;
  17 c 0019   m: procedure;
  18 e 0019      dcl x fixed dec(9,2);
  19 e 001C      x = 3;
  20 e 002C      call n;
  21 e 002F      n: procedure;
  22 g 002F         x = 3;
  23 e 0043         end n;
  24 c 0044      end m;
  25 a 0044 end E52H;

CODE SIZE = 0047
DATA AREA = 0010
FREE SYMS = 3889
END  COMPILATION
